sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Postman
  participant R as Route
  participant C as Controller
  participant M as Mongoose Model
  participant D as MongoDB
  P->>R: GET /api/destinations/discover?category=Beach&sort=price
  R->>C: discoverDestinations()
  C->>C: validate and build filter, sort, page
  C->>M: find(filter).sort().skip().limit()
  M->>D: query destinations
  D-->>M: matching documents
  C->>M: countDocuments(filter)
  M-->>C: total
  C-->>P: 200 { success, page, total, data }
